{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c4a1e8d2-7b35-4f90-a6d1-2e5b9c8f3a17",
    "name": "Dentalkart Customer Cart and Orders",
    "description": "Customer-side cart, addresses, checkout and orders (the website API). Flat list, press Send from top to bottom.\n\nSetup: \"php artisan migrate:fresh --seed\" and \"php artisan db:seed --class=ProductDemoSeeder\", then \"php artisan serve\". Variables: base_url = http://localhost:8000/api/v1 ; customer_token, cart_token, address_id, order_number are filled by the requests themselves ; variant_id = 21 (an option with bulk prices) and variant_id_2 = 22 are valid after the seeding above.\n\nA guest can use the cart without a login (X-Cart-Token); placing an order needs the customer login. Logins, product lists, categories and reviews are in the other collections. All amounts are in PKR (Rs) and include all taxes. Errors: 422 { message, code, errors } - \"message\" is ready to show, \"code\" is stable.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
