            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "description": "Seed customer test@gmail.com / test (500 demo coins and one saved address). The guest cart (cart_token) is merged into the customer cart: the same option is added up, capped by the stock and the maximum order quantity; the answer says how many lines were merged (cart_lines_merged). A token works once. Placing an order needs this login.",
