    {
      "name": "18. Place order (cash on delivery)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('idempotency_key', pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const j = pm.response.json();",
              "if (j.data && j.data.order_number) { pm.collectionVariables.set('order_number', j.data.order_number); }",
              "pm.test('order_number saved', () => pm.expect(j.data.order_number).to.match(/^DK-\\d{4}-\\d{6}$/));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{customer_token}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Idempotency-Key",
            "value": "{{idempotency_key}}"
          }
        ],
        "description": "Needs the customer login and items in the Standard cart (use the cart requests above first; if the cart is empty the answer is 422 cart_empty). In ONE transaction the server re-checks prices, bulk prices, stock, quantity limits, the COD limit and the address, then creates the order (snapshots of every line and both addresses), takes the stock, debits the coins and empties the cart. 201 = new order; the order_number is saved. Use address_id of a saved address, or send an inline \"address\" object (same fields) instead. Optional: billing_address_id, expected_total (the total the customer saw: 409 price_changed if it moved). Every send creates a NEW Idempotency-Key.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"address_id\": \"{{address_id}}\",\n  \"payment_method\": \"cod\",\n  \"coins_to_redeem\": 100,\n  \"customer_note\": \"Please call before delivery\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/store/orders?channel=standard",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "store",
            "orders"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "channel",
              "value": "standard"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "19. Place order again with the SAME Idempotency-Key (no second order)",
